      <div class="group">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink group-hover:text-brand transition-colors flex items-start">
          <span class="text-brand mr-4 text-3xl leading-none">Q.</span>
          I have supposedly been in a constant calorie deficit for weeks, but the damn scale isn't moving or showing weight loss. Why does this happen?
